[{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:0b2ee2fe478594ef68998c068960f2a8bc4037208ec8dd87ed9669501ce889a1","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"プロデューサー君、おはよう！\n気持ちの良い挨拶から始める\n仕事は、いいものだな！","sourceHash":"0b2ee2fe478594ef68998c068960f2a8bc4037208ec8dd87ed9669501ce889a1","translation":"制作人君，早上好！\n精神饱满地打声招呼再开始工作，\n真是不错啊！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_05","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:13478dae354ca3623039c6dc5e33216a54f2bbb9ee0bf398d7e047fefd23ca79","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"トレーナーに、声量を\n褒められたぞ！　さらに練習に\n励まねばな！","sourceHash":"13478dae354ca3623039c6dc5e33216a54f2bbb9ee0bf398d7e047fefd23ca79","translation":"训练师夸我音量够大了！\n得更加努力\n练习才行！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_04","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:6ad77aca0effe93b9d80bb631439501bdbfadc873bdfed91c6fa99ee9c3693ee","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"君の仕事ぶりには感謝するが\n自身のことも大事にしたまえ。\n君もまた、唯一の存在だからな。","sourceHash":"6ad77aca0effe93b9d80bb631439501bdbfadc873bdfed91c6fa99ee9c3693ee","translation":"感谢你在工作中的付出，\n但也要珍惜自己。\n因为你也是独一无二的存在啊。","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_06","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:719a102a651fcf84c625d536c6ff94e450d5dd6764a3cc2d30de8dcb3371ab82","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"賢と釣りに行くことになった。\n無論、アイドルたるもの、\n日焼けには注意しなければな！","sourceHash":"719a102a651fcf84c625d536c6ff94e450d5dd6764a3cc2d30de8dcb3371ab82","translation":"我要和贤去钓鱼了。\n当然，身为偶像，\n必须注意防晒！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_03","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:77b218541d0f6c06181cb60a4fdca29efe20946854bfacef5eb5408cd632fae2","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"遅くまでご苦労！　君の頑張りが\nあるから、我々アイドルも\n仕事に傾注できるのだ！","sourceHash":"77b218541d0f6c06181cb60a4fdca29efe20946854bfacef5eb5408cd632fae2","translation":"这么晚了辛苦了！正因为有你的努力，\n我们偶像才能\n专心投入工作！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_12","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:77e175be206ad1fbfc3137ffce08c8d97a104698530c58fb2403f4df48c10e2f","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"今日もそろそろ折り返しだ。\n残された時間も有意義に\n過ごそうではないか！","sourceHash":"77e175be206ad1fbfc3137ffce08c8d97a104698530c58fb2403f4df48c10e2f","translation":"今天也差不多过半了。\n剩下的时间也让我们\n过得有意义吧！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_07","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:85a1ac8c9780e308c730d09e0f3a4efa848da674867cd60d15a466e53460ed28","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"プロデューサー君、いい所に。\nSNSに載せる写真だが、どちらの\nポーズが映えるか判定を頼む！","sourceHash":"85a1ac8c9780e308c730d09e0f3a4efa848da674867cd60d15a466e53460ed28","translation":"制作人君，来得正好。\n要发到SNS上的照片，\n帮我判断哪个姿势更上镜！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_11","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:94aba2a66a88ed0abc265d3f7f63785882d3fc13c5f728ca9334a16b216b2fec","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"うむ、呼んだか？\n……違う？　もしや、君ではなく\n君のパッションの叫びか？","sourceHash":"94aba2a66a88ed0abc265d3f7f63785882d3fc13c5f728ca9334a16b216b2fec","translation":"嗯，叫我了吗？\n……不是？莫非，不是你，\n而是你的PASSION在呼喊？","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_01","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:95523737f5124acbdba2f50290da712681238f4543c6799e4164e21754e0ad9a","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"君のパッションには感心する。\n今度、アイドル論をとことん\n語り合いたいものだ！","sourceHash":"95523737f5124acbdba2f50290da712681238f4543c6799e4164e21754e0ad9a","translation":"你的PASSION令我佩服。\n下次真想和你\n尽情畅谈一番偶像论！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_09","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:acf6cd53819e9aa9854575ba2153c7043b67cb5ed41062b65002c5189f8be401","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"私がアイドルとして輝くには\n君の力がなくてはならない。\n頼んだぞ、プロデューサー君！","sourceHash":"acf6cd53819e9aa9854575ba2153c7043b67cb5ed41062b65002c5189f8be401","translation":"我要作为偶像闪耀，\n不能没有你的力量。\n拜托了，制作人君！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_02","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:b0927c79027a702ad8d457a6e4dc897bc6b8fa068fb9081c2ef54947be38f27f","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"外のベンチでうたた寝をした？\n春眠暁を覚えずと言うが、\n体は冷やさないようにな！","sourceHash":"b0927c79027a702ad8d457a6e4dc897bc6b8fa068fb9081c2ef54947be38f27f","translation":"在外面的长椅上打了个盹？\n虽说春眠不觉晓，\n可别让身体着凉啊！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_14","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:bd73511012afa6ac827215e8dbdc9263b7f8c15429b85bafe305c2222e125595","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"アイドル、ファン、スタッフ……\n皆のパッションがひとつとなり\n最高のステージが完成するのだ！","sourceHash":"bd73511012afa6ac827215e8dbdc9263b7f8c15429b85bafe305c2222e125595","translation":"偶像、粉丝、工作人员……\n大家的PASSION合而为一，\n最棒的舞台才得以完成！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_10","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:bd9b7a63364f4e1379e6487d0b399c04ed5c7cdcfcad3ffaa7abbd1d048774fa","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"昼食がまだなら、一緒に\nたまこやの弁当を\n買いに行かないか？","sourceHash":"bd9b7a63364f4e1379e6487d0b399c04ed5c7cdcfcad3ffaa7abbd1d048774fa","translation":"还没吃午饭的话，要不要一起\n去买玉子屋的\n便当？","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_08","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:d08c2641a31b63584b6f63a5d62bb51d0f214f9aa37f94b7115c312307c79297","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"トップアイドルの座を掴むため、\n共に励もうではないか！\n君の活躍を期待しているぞ！","sourceHash":"d08c2641a31b63584b6f63a5d62bb51d0f214f9aa37f94b7115c312307c79297","translation":"为了夺得顶级偶像的宝座，\n一起努力吧！\n我很期待你的表现！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_00","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"},{"key":"metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:f5bffb54a5a5e6089c962495d0879b50ae4c213d1c32ca038cd2c89e7a1e152e","kind":"unused-voice","field":"text","source":"花見に行くなら、私が特製の\n栄養ドリンクを用意しよう！\n体の芯から元気になるぞ！","sourceHash":"f5bffb54a5a5e6089c962495d0879b50ae4c213d1c32ca038cd2c89e7a1e152e","translation":"要去赏花的话，我来准备\n特制的营养饮料！\n能让你浑身都充满活力！","status":"draft","batch":"G-card-lines-20261104-006","references":[{"kind":"unused-voice","id":"3_1_102_13","field":"text","speaker":"102sha"}],"notes":[],"translator":"Claude Opus 5.5","decision":"translated"}]
